      "description": "The canonical sigoalumni LogQL starter set. Live versions render in the three panels below; these are the copy-paste sources for ad-hoc Explore work.",
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 38 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### sigoalumni — Loki starter queries\n\nDatasource: **Loki**. Log streams: app + cloud-sql-proxy share the pod under `{app=\"sigoalumni\"}` (split by `container`); the dedicated tunnel is `{app=\"cloudflare-tunnel-sigoalumni\"}`.\n\n**1. App error lines (Next.js container)**\n```logql\n{app=\"sigoalumni\", container=\"app\"} |~ `(?i)(error|exception|unhandled|fatal|ECONNREFUSED|ETIMEDOUT|failed)`\n```\n\n**2. cloud-sql-proxy connection errors** — line-filter form (robust), or JSON form for structured severity:\n```logql\n{app=\"sigoalumni\", container=\"cloud-sql-proxy\"} |~ `(?i)(error|refused|failed|denied|could not|timeout)`\n# structured: proxy logs are JSON with a severity field\n{app=\"sigoalumni\", container=\"cloud-sql-proxy\"} | json | severity=~`ERROR|WARNING|CRITICAL`\n```\n\n**3. cloudflared tunnel disconnects (sigoalumni tunnel)**\n```logql\n{app=\"cloudflare-tunnel-sigoalumni\"} |~ `(?i)(terminated|retrying connection|unregistered|failed to serve|serve tunnel error|lost connection|connection error|ERR )`\n```\n\n**Rate helpers** (metric queries — use as timeseries):\n```logql\nsum(rate({app=\"sigoalumni\", container=\"app\"} |~ `(?i)(error|exception|fatal)` [5m]))\nsum(rate({app=\"sigoalumni\", container=\"cloud-sql-proxy\"} |= \"Accepted connection\" [5m]))\n```\n"
      }
    },
